title: FindFriendDialogue
---
<<declare $emiDialogPhase = "">>
<<dialogPhaseSetter EmiNPC>>


<<if $emiDialogPhase == "start">>
<<jump Start>>
<<elseif $emiDialogPhase == "quest_taken">>
<<jump quest_taken_return>>
<<elseif $emiDialogPhase == "quest_complete">>
<<jump quest_complete>>
<<elseif $emiDialogPhase == "quest_complete_return">>
<<jump quest_complete_return>>
<<else>>
Emi: I don't understand...
<<endif>>
===
title: Start
---
//<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
//<<portrait Emi>>
Emi: Hey Mokki! uhhh, question...
Emi: I cant seem to find our other friend...
Emi: He went into the kitchen to go get some ice cream for the both of us... but hasen't come back since.
Emi: I'm a little worried...
Emi: Can you help me?
//<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
//<<portrait Mokki>>
    ->Of course!
        <<dialogPhaseGetter EmiNPC "quest_taken">>
        Emi: Thank you!!! :D
        Emi: I'd say... check the kitchen. He might be there!
        //<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
        //<<portrait Mokki>>
    ->Sorry, not right now.
        //<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===
title:quest_taken_return
---
//<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
//<<portrait Emi>>
Emi: Hey, did you find him?
    //<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    //<<portrait Mokki>>
    ->Not yet...
    Emi: hmm...have you checked the kitchen?
        //<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===
title:quest_complete
---
<<if $visitedYet == false>>
<<set $visitedYet to true>>
//<<portrait Emi>>
Emi: Hey! You found him!
    //<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    //<<portrait Mokki>>
    ->He was stuck inside of the fridge.
        <<dialogPhaseGetter EmiNPC "quest_complete_return">>
        //<<portrait Emi>>
        Emi: Really? 
        Emi: You know what...yeah. That sound about right. 
        Emi: Thank you so much!
<<endif>>
===
title:quest_complete_return
---
//<<portrait Emi>>
Emi: Thanks again Mokki!
===